WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.464
SAFE. A child keeps dry hands near an approved switch.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:07.355
DANGER. Highlight exposed wires with a stop symbol.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:11.227
DANGER. Show water beside plugged-in devices.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:15.675
ACT. Child moves away and informs a responsible adult.
